"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.75.160","content_hash":"a7b441898b3a37c5ae3f219476b8a938ac3effd50a597c0e643fa52501ad622d","heading":null,"ordinal":3,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.75.160:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.75.160:block:3","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.75.160","text":"(2) The permittee has filed a request for renewal.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"dfdb3bff-5f65-58fa-be6e-e3f187da6226"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.75.160","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.75.160","content_hash":"fcbf52265a2c435fe30393217b8c2219f85760c0dcb42b8e2e9bdbfe1c0f2ff9","heading":null,"ordinal":4,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.75.160:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.75.160:block:4","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.75.160","text":"(3) The permittee has submitted with the application for renewal a revised inventory showing the items listed on the original inventory remaining unsold and not listing any goods not included in the original application and inventory. (Code 1981 § 37-43. Code 1995 § 30-165.)","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"caccacd1-0959-5b5d-b48a-cfbe9aa94245"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.75.160","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.75.160","content_hash":"547b4e6a10c399a196aa412a4781d80cc47ea4b405a5933441203369ce0262c5","heading":null,"ordinal":5,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.75.160:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.75.160:block:5","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.75.160","text":"Cross References: City Clerk, TMC 2.20.010 .","type":"paragraph","workbench_componen